## Complete incremental attribute reassignment

Context: Re-Assign Missing Attributes could finish successfully while attribute coverage stayed near 10%. The ontology tool silently exposed only the first 30 attributes per entity, existing mappings were counted as current-run results, and a retry could replace rather than extend prior attribute assignments.

Changes:

1. .planning/agents/agent_auto_assignment/PLAN.md
   Documented the incremental reassignment contract, failure modes, success criteria, and implementation plan.
2. .planning/agents/agent_auto_assignment/SPEC.md
   Completed the relevant tool surface and added attribute visibility, merge safety, and coverage reporting requirements.
3. .planning/agents/agent_auto_assignment/eval/dataset.jsonl
   Added production-derived wide-entity, incremental-merge, and projection-safety regression cases.
4. src/agents/agent_auto_assignment/engine.py
   Tracks only submissions made by the current run, reports attribute coverage, guides SQL projection extension, and raises the output budget for wide mappings.
5. src/agents/tools/context.py
   Tracks entity and relationship URIs submitted during the current agent run.
6. src/agents/tools/mapping.py
   Merges incremental attribute assignments, preserves exclusions and unmapped details, and rejects SQL that drops valid mapped output columns.
7. src/agents/tools/ontology.py
   Removed the 30-attribute truncation and returns every pending attribute with existing mapping context.
8. src/back/objects/mapping/Mapping.py
   Preserves existing attribute mappings during session merges and publishes requested, mapped, and remaining attribute statistics.
9. src/front/static/mapping/js/mapping-autoassign.js
   Sends only missing attributes during reassignment and reports the true missing-attribute count.
10. tests/eval/datasets/agent_auto_assignment/regression.jsonl
    Mirrored the three production regression cases in the committed evaluation dataset.
11. tests/units/agents/test_auto_assignment_engine.py
    Added current-run accounting and expanded output-budget regressions.
12. tests/units/agents/test_mapping_tools.py
    Added incremental merge and SQL projection preservation regressions.
13. tests/units/mapping/test_attribute_exclusion.py
    Added a wide-entity regression proving every pending attribute remains visible.
14. tests/units/mapping/test_auto_assign_observability.py
    Added attribute-level completion reporting and non-destructive session merge regressions.

